  "about": {
    "description": "wAAPLx is the ERC-4626 wrapped version of AAPLx (Apple xStock). It wraps AAPLx into a standardized vault-share token to enable DeFi composability such as use as collateral in lending markets, automated strategies, and other yield protocols. Each wAAPLx represents a share claim on deposited AAPLx. Underlying real-world exposure, redemption mechanics, and reference price tracking are inherited from the underlying AAPLx xStock issued by Backed. The wrapper does not rebase, so its share-to-underlying ratio grows with the xStocks multiplier, making it a total-return tracker rather than a price-parity tracker.",
